sbuild-auth-pam.cc compares the PAM prompts against
dgettext(PAM_TEXT_DOMAIN, "Password: ") but never includes <libintl.h>: it
only compiled while NLS was enabled, because sbuild-i18n.h pulls the
declaration in transitively.  OHOS's libc ships no gettext (the sysroot
libintl.h is an empty stub and there is no libintl), so gettext is taken
from the gettext package; include the header explicitly so the
declaration no longer depends on an unrelated feature switch.  Pure
include, no platform conditional.

--- a/sbuild/sbuild-auth-pam.cc
+++ b/sbuild/sbuild-auth-pam.cc
@@ -30,6 +30,7 @@
 #include <sstream>
 
 #include <syslog.h>
+#include <libintl.h>
 
 #include <boost/format.hpp>
 
